  "introduction": [
    "A gallant warrior who channels a dragon’s pride and relentless strength. They surge into combat, striking first and laying their power bare for all to see. They are experts at forcing combatants to engage them directly, with a unique ability to best defend against the attacks of those who do not meet them on their terms—a distillation of the dragon spirit’s heightened perception."
